sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Screen / ViewModel
    participant M as ModeAwareFeedRepository
    participant N as NextcloudFeedRepository
    participant DB as Room
    participant WM as WorkManager
    participant F as PendingChangeFlusher
    participant S as Nextcloud server

    UI->>M: setRead(id, true)
    M->>N: current() = Nextcloud
    N->>DB: articles.setRead (UI updates via Flow)
    N->>DB: enqueue pending_changes (article, field, value)
    N->>WM: scheduleFlush (needs network, REPLACE)
    WM->>F: FlushWorker.doWork
    F->>DB: read pending_changes, resolve remoteId
    Note over F: changes for articles with no remoteId are dropped
    F->>S: markRead / markUnread / star / unstar (batched)
    alt all batches accepted
        F->>DB: deleteIfUnchanged for each sent change
    else failure
        F-->>WM: retry with 30 s exponential backoff
    end
